<title>CHINA: Great Wall year net profit up one pct.</title>
<headline>Great Wall year net profit up one pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.8	vs 9.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0	vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs 18.09 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    91.28    vs 90.40</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,839.65 vs 3,389.42</p>
<p>    Company name		 Great Wall Electronic International</p>
<p>				     Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 22-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 18</p>
<p>NOTE - Great Wall manufactures consumer electronic products.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is four H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs one cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
